核心代码示例 (Vue 3 逻辑)：

```javascript
const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
  (entries) => {
    if (entries[0].isIntersecting && !loading.value && hasMore.value) {
      loadMoreData();
    }
  },
  { threshold: 0.5 },
);

onMounted(() => {
  observer.observe(loadMoreTrigger.value);
});
```
